Subject: [PATCH] fix(worker): use authoritative account boards for slot census
 [daveey]

Composed census added current scratch HERMES_HOME and named symlinks after filtering inventory. Pass authoritative board_paths only for worker admission; preserve generic metrics discovery semantics. Discover canonical profile boards before registration and deduplicate discovery/records. RED: five composed failures against initial guard; GREEN: 81 focused tests, plus 1190 passing consumer tests before updating one strict fake signature. Full scripts/check: 20 checks OK. Mutation and independent review pending.
---
